<?php require __DIR__.'/includes/functions.php'; $title='Store terms'; require ROOT.'/includes/header.php'; ?><div class="content-page glass my-5"><p class="eyebrow">STORE INFORMATION</p><h1>Store terms</h1><p>This NEXORA installation is a demonstration store. Sample products and prices are supplied for testing; verify availability with the operator before relying on an order for a real purchase.</p><h2>Orders and pricing</h2><p>Prices are shown in Philippine pesos. Order totals include the displayed shipping and applicable coupon discount. Stock is reserved when an order is placed. An administrator reviews and updates order status.</p><h2>Payments</h2><p>Cash on delivery orders are marked due on delivery. GCash, Maya and card choices do not collect payments and are marked Demo - unpaid. Never send card details through contact messages.</p><h2>Your account</h2><p>Keep your credentials private and supply accurate delivery details. Contact the store operator about cancellation, returns, or account assistance.</p><p>Store operators must replace these demonstration terms with policies appropriate to their actual business before accepting real sales.</p></div><?php require ROOT.'/includes/footer.php'; ?>
